gsipper (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Settings dialog (start minimized / run on start / record calls).
  * Call recording: WAV via PJSUA2, MP3 conversion via ffmpeg,
    in-app playback dialog with timeline and transport buttons.
  * Window X button hides to tray; SIP stays registered. Real quit
    via win.quit / Ctrl+Q / tray-extension Quit.
  * Bundle pjsua2 (built locally with pjproject 2.15) into the deb.
  * Extension metadata: shell-version 45..49 + numeric version=1.

 -- pulpoff <noreply@pulpoff.com>  Tue, 19 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000

gsipper (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * Bundled GNOME-Shell status-bar extension at
    /usr/share/gnome-shell/extensions/gsipper@pulpoff.com.
  * `gsipper --install-pjsua2` builds the PJSUA2 Python bindings
    from source into the user cache.

